# https://github.com/sbt/sbt/issues/9729
# Each artifact is PUT under its plain -SNAPSHOT name, so a repository with unique
# snapshot naming stamps every upload separately and maven-metadata.xml ends up
# pointing at a jar that was never published.
> cleanPublishRepo
> startPublishServer
> a/publish
# flip to `>` once the publication uses a single qualifier
-> checkSnapshotConsistency
> stopPublishServer
